WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:00.963
- Hey guys, how's it going?

00:00:00.963 --> 00:00:02.920
So I was just sitting
playing Zelda and I thought

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:05.230
'hey, I still have all my
recording stuff set up,

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.560
so why not record some
game play for you guys?'

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.230
You seemed to enjoy it the last time,

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.240
and in response to a
bunch of your comments,

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.330
I was talking about how I didn't pre-order

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:14.510
anything but the Switch.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:17.030
No accessories, no anything,
and the case I showed

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.700
in my last video was so awful.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.660
I packaged it back up
and I'm returning it.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.400
Unfortunately, I kind of destroyed the box

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.812
so I hope that they accept it as a return.

00:00:25.812 --> 00:00:27.317
I hated everything about that case.

00:00:27.317 --> 00:00:29.280
One of my favorite
comments was everybody was

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.540
comparing it to an old school CD case,

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.850
which you're right, it did look like that.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:36.218
Today we're gonna take a
peek at the pro controller.

00:00:36.218 --> 00:00:38.170
(box and plastic ripping)

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:39.003
Very nice!

00:00:39.003 --> 00:00:42.943
It comes with a charger
cable, USBC, thank you!

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:49.040
Wow, this is a really nice feel.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.940
Too bad I've basically
beat the entire game

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.140
using that little tiny controller dock,

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.950
which surprisingly isn't that bad.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:56.440
I actually kind of like it.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.210
I mean, this is such a better feel though.

00:00:58.210 --> 00:00:59.857
There's a lot of weight to it as well.

00:00:59.857 --> 00:01:02.370
This doesn't feel bad to me.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:05.380
What's interesting is depending
upon how you hold this,

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:09.190
those joysticks are about
the same width apart.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:11.520
They're a little bit further
apart on this guy though.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:12.353
But not by much!

00:01:12.353 --> 00:01:13.290
Now I wanna show you guys some

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.050
of the cases that I decided to go with.

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:16.460
This one, it's perfect!

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.390
It is a nice (knocks) hard shell.

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:21.070
It's got a nice little place
here to put your Switch

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:22.670
when you have the joy cons attached.

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:24.630
It's got a place for your games,

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:26.450
and it's got some little areas up here to

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:28.100
put your chords and whatever else

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.570
you might wanna be putting in there.

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:31.350
In case you're short on room,

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:34.030
this is an even harder
shell cover. (knocks)

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.650
It's got a place here for the tablet,

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:38.010
a place for games, and
I like this has a little

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.070
zipper pocket up here.

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:41.630
You could put your joy cons, your cables,

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:46.460
and, um, candy?
(zipper zips)

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:50.060
Got a little hanging wrist
strap which is very nice.

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:51.790
Those zippers are really loud!

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:54.780
This one has a nice
little carrying handle,

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.410
and it also comes with this little clip.

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:58.950
These are so much better,

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:01.160
there's actually no comparison at all.

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:03.560
This is another case, but this
is actually for my Mavic Pro.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:04.820
This'll be in a separate video,

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:07.470
I'm going to be doing one about
how I transport my drones,

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:10.000
and what cases I use
and this juts came in.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.140
So here's a sneak peak!

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:12.090
It's got a place for the drone and

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.380
also a place for the controller.

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:15.850
(zips zipper)
Future video right here!

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:17.500
So those are the cases that I'm probably

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:18.333
going to be using.

00:02:18.333 --> 00:02:20.140
I feel like this is going
to be the one that I

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.360
use most of the time.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.930
It fits in my backpack, and it
fits pretty nicely everywhere

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:26.440
and I can also just take it to go,

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:28.230
and use it as a little purse.

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:30.300
There's no logos,
there's no nothing on it.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:31.133
I like that!

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:32.150
This one has a tiny little logo,

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:33.710
but I can't really tell what it even is,

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:34.950
so it doesn't really matter.

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.640
I like no logos, I like
just plain, basic, simple.

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.910
Now I've taken a peek at those cases,

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.880
should we play some Zelda then?

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:44.420
I'm not really sure where I'm gonna go,

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:46.990
I just officially unlocked the entire map.

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:49.000
There's a few places that
I haven't really explored

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.420
very much, but, I don't know!

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:52.253
Let's see.

00:02:52.253 --> 00:02:53.830
If you don't want any spoilers whatsoever,

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:55.470
you can stop watching
now, but I'm not gonna

00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:57.340
give any storyline spoilers,

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.830
but I might be showing you some things

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:00.570
that you haven't actually
got to in the game.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.000
So there's your heads up!

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:02.833
Let's play!

00:03:02.833 --> 00:03:05.340
Let me get my blanket
so I'm nice and comfy.

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:06.960
We're gonna play this game!

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:07.793
Where am I?

00:03:07.793 --> 00:03:08.710
I just got to this area,

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:11.580
I just unlocked the Lakeside Stable.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:16.090
Let's see, I just picked up
a scale from this dragon.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.180
I'm not sure where I gotta go,

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.810
cause I know there's probably
a secret shrine there.

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:20.710
Farosh's Scale.

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.510
This precious scale that
contains powerful electricity...

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.130
Most of the scales that you'll find,

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:27.310
you need to throw them
into a little spring.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:28.960
Oh, what's that?

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:31.113
I hear, there's a shrine nearby!

00:03:32.694 --> 00:03:34.130
(soft music)
Where is it?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.612
It's probably up there somewhere.

00:03:36.612 --> 00:03:38.226
Look at these bananas!

00:03:38.226 --> 00:03:39.440
Yes!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:40.740
I'm assuming it's up here.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:46.520
God, I have no patience for
climbing up mountains, at all.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:49.480
I just wanna keep hitting 'x' and jump

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.270
all the way up there to my victory.

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:53.650
So here's the unfortunate
reality the fact that I

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:56.089
just jumped up here, it doesn't seem

00:03:56.089 --> 00:03:58.110
like that shrine is up here.

00:03:58.110 --> 00:03:59.440
He made me really upset!

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:01.000
Okay, that was an accident. (laughs)

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.390
It seems like it's inside here!

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:04.927
Well how do I get in there?!

00:04:06.551 --> 00:04:09.801
(soft music from game)

00:04:10.679 --> 00:04:12.002
(gasps)
Right here!

00:04:12.002 --> 00:04:13.162
Right here!

00:04:13.162 --> 00:04:14.680
How did I miss it?!
I missed it!

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:18.943
God, this is why I have 100
freakin' hours of this game!

00:04:22.554 --> 00:04:24.830
(explosion on game)

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.130
(grunts)

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:29.330
When something seems like it should be

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:31.483
the way that it is usually is.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.170
If somebody, you think, is being an idiot

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.910
and they're screwing
you over or something,

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:38.080
they probably are! (blows raspberry)

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.760
Many times I've been
screwed over to learn that.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.453
Let's go, let's see what
this shrine has to offer.

00:04:44.365 --> 00:04:45.553
(grunts)
Oh no!

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:54.123
Halt the Tilt, well this should be fun.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:59.460
Oh geeze, it literally
tells you what to do,

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:01.720
but yet I still ran up it knowing exactly

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:03.462
what was gonna happen.

00:05:03.462 --> 00:05:05.962
(game chimes)

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.290
Oh geez!
Oh god!

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:10.620
Oh boy!
Oh man!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.630
We're gonna go over here first.

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:14.190
Let's get, let's see what's in here.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:16.163
A nice little present perhaps?

00:05:18.661 --> 00:05:19.760
(game chimes)

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.552
My inventory is full.

00:05:21.552 --> 00:05:22.385
Hmm, guess it doesn't matter then!

00:05:23.426 --> 00:05:25.418
(game rings)

00:05:25.418 --> 00:05:27.090
(game chimes)

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:31.323
Alright, so there's our
little end goal there.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.680
Is there something up there?

00:05:38.912 --> 00:05:41.412
(game chimes)

00:05:44.245 --> 00:05:49.245
No!
(game chimes)

00:05:49.883 --> 00:05:51.570
Okay, well we made it!

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.980
Oh, but I wanna go up there!

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:55.603
Can I just....

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:58.093
Use my Magnesis?

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.060
Okay, looks like we can't do that.

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:05.490
Well it's probably something dumb,

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:07.000
and I don't care.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.270
And if it is something awesome,

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:10.680
I'm gonna be super upset about it later,

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.913
but I can always come back.
(game chimes)

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:16.833
Cool story, let's roll.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:19.760
So really great story,

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.700
when I was talking to
you guys the last time

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:24.930
about my inventory and
I couldn't find the guy

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:27.170
to upgrade my inventory slots,

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.580
I never upgraded the
first time that I met him,

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:33.290
so I was going to all of
these freaking stables

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.660
going absolutely nuts, trying to find him.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.910
I was already in the forest
where he would have been

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.490
if I had met him at the stables,

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:40.960
and I go back to his original location,

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:44.040
and he is just there shaking his maracas,

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.620
saying 'baby, you wanna upgrade?'

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:50.480
And I felt like such an absolute idiot.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:52.320
I was like, I can't
believe he's still here.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:53.153
He's still here!

00:06:53.153 --> 00:06:55.483
Okay so I need to find a spring somewhere.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:01.430
I gotta go up here because
I already got my dragon

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:04.780
and then it's this way.

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:06.560
Let's travel up here and
then we'll just hop down

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.050
and see what we can see what we can see.

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:10.040
So whenever you get the
scales from the dragons,

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.610
you have to defeat the one
dragon and then the other two

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.600
I'm not sure if you have
to defeat them later,

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:16.240
but you shoot them and you get a scale,

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.890
and then you take the scale
and you drop it into a spring,

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:21.070
and then you open up a secret shrine!

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:22.880
I love this game so much.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:26.810
I like hate everything
about what I've become.

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:28.742
I can't wait to beat it.

00:07:28.742 --> 00:07:31.250
Oh, look at you guys, just
fighting down there like pigs.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.720
I'm gonna have a lot of
things to do to get to there.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.710
Hopefully this is even the
spring that I need to get to,

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:37.230
or I'm gonna be so upset.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.590
What's great is if you're
just staring this game,

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:41.420
you're gonna have absolutely
no idea what I'm talking about.

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:42.667
It's not even really gonna matter.

00:07:42.667 --> 00:07:44.800
But then when you do get to these parts,

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:47.030
you're gonna be like 'oh,
that's right! That's right.'

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:50.483
This is actually pretty easy.

00:07:52.019 --> 00:07:53.820
(game whooshes)
(game chimes)

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:57.700
I hate those stupid things,
I forget what they're called,

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:58.743
but they're dumb!

00:08:00.093 --> 00:08:01.440
I think what I might do,

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:03.730
let me make sure I have my armor on.

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:05.850
Oh shoot, I wanted to drive, but whatever.

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:07.100
It's not even a big deal.

00:08:08.644 --> 00:08:11.610
(game splashes)

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.023
Let's swim up here.

00:08:17.442 --> 00:08:19.917
(game chimes)

00:08:19.917 --> 00:08:22.720
(groans)
Get off of me!

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:24.340
You stupid!

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:25.173
Idiot!

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.450
And you know what else?!

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.240
You're also an idiot!

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:31.210
Come on, oh shoot, I missed him.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:32.270
I missed him!

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:33.103
You're dumb.

00:08:34.232 --> 00:08:36.643
I hate your stupid skeleton head.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.013
I hate your stupid freaking face.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:48.290
I'm gonna stasis your dumb mouth.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.590
I need to be using regular arrows

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.233
cause I'm really wasting those.

00:08:52.259 --> 00:08:53.092
(game chimes)

00:08:53.092 --> 00:08:53.925
Gonna give you just one extra shot,

00:08:53.925 --> 00:08:56.093
just because you're a idiot.

00:08:56.987 --> 00:08:59.487
(game chimes)

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:11.133
Okay, this is, this is what we came for.

00:09:13.148 --> 00:09:15.648
(game chimes)

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:22.810
It's like I feel almost
like it's cheating,

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:26.113
but okay leave me alone.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:31.930
Oh, no no no, come back!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.410
Hey show yourself to me baby!

00:09:38.214 --> 00:09:40.714
(game chimes)

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:44.353
Come here!

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:46.273
Pig!

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:51.680
I need to figure out about these things

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:54.940
because it looks like
there's something cool there,

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:57.720
but I haven't figured it out yet.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:58.650
Is that the dragon?

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:00.082
Is he here?!
He's here!

00:10:00.082 --> 00:10:02.240
There he is!
There he is!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:05.450
Oh, he's so...
I absolutely love the music

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:06.530
when the dragon is around.

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:07.590
Oh god, that's scary.

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:08.580
So it looks like there's a shrine

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.300
somewhere super super close.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:12.100
It's gotta be behind this waterfall!

00:10:15.696 --> 00:10:19.887
So this doesn't look to
be what I was hoping for.

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:26.110
Because usually there's a statue

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:29.913
and maybe it's over here?

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:34.073
Oh man!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:36.973
Did I go all this way for nothing?

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:42.260
Hey!
Hey!

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:43.563
Stop shooting me!

00:10:48.879 --> 00:10:53.546
(game chimes)
(scoffs)

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.930
God I hate these stupid idiots.

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:58.823
Stop it!

00:11:01.751 --> 00:11:04.251
(game chimes)

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:09.610
Okay well this is not good.

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:11.383
Oh, you're looking for your head?!

00:11:11.383 --> 00:11:12.484
Oh you're gonna take that one?!

00:11:12.484 --> 00:11:13.808
Good for you, well guess what?!

00:11:13.808 --> 00:11:14.641
I'm destroying this head
so no one can have it!

00:11:14.641 --> 00:11:15.840
Then no one can have it!

00:11:16.793 --> 00:11:18.667
And I want your stupid arm!

00:11:18.667 --> 00:11:20.967
(game chimes)

00:11:20.967 --> 00:11:24.350
I'm in struggle city right now!

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.250
Here he is!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:26.083
Where are you going?

00:11:26.083 --> 00:11:28.250
So, where are you going buddy?

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.323
He's going in there!

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:34.823
Oh man!
Oh man!

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:38.783
That's where his home is.

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:41.143
Okay.

00:11:43.993 --> 00:11:46.213
Oh no my, oh here, I'll get another scale.

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:48.833
Shoot!

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:55.440
If you see, he dropped
the scale over here.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:56.410
So hey, that's cool!

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:57.920
I'll have two.

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:59.513
Get up, pick it up!

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:02.880
Great. That's exciting!

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:05.360
I had to look it up because I don't know.

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:06.573
This is so far away!

00:12:07.685 --> 00:12:11.226
It looks like it is somewhere over here.

00:12:11.226 --> 00:12:13.711
I bet it's over here.

00:12:13.711 --> 00:12:15.933
